// The USB device controller, which Renode's own nRF52840 platform leaves out
// entirely. On these boards it is the console: the Adafruit core makes Serial a
// TinyUSB CDC device, so without this a published image prints into a peripheral
// that is not there.
usbd: USB.NRF52840_USBD @ sysbus 0x40027000
    -> nvic@39
